[1e-05, "o", "\u001b[37m\u001b[40mSomewhere at the bottom of this claim lies the \u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m\u001b[40mHeartstone\u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m, the\u001b[30m\u001b[40mx\u001b[17b\r\u001b[4d\u001b[37m\u001b[40mgreat stone every miner in the valley has heard of and nobody has seen.\u001b[30m\u001b[40mx\u001b[8b\r\u001b[5d"]
[1.8e-05, "o", "\u001b[37m\u001b[40mDig down, sell what you find at the shop (\u001b[34m\u001b[40m=\u001b[37m\u001b[40m), buy better tools,\u001b[30m\u001b[40mx\u001b[16b\r\u001b[6d\u001b[37m\u001b[40mand go deeper, until you can bring the Heartstone up into the daylight.\u001b[30m\u001b[40mx\u001b[8b\u001b[7;27H"]
[8e-06, "o", "x\u001b[6b\u001b[7;61Hx\u001b[19b\r\u001b[8d"]
[8e-06, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[37m\u001b[40mMoving and digging\u001b[8;27H\u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[30m\u001b[40mx\u001b[6b\u001b[8;61H"]
[7e-06, "o", "x\u001b[19b\r\u001b[9d\u001b[37m\u001b[40m  arrows or hjkl   walk; walk into ground to dig it\u001b[9;61H"]
[1.5e-05, "o", "\u001b[30m\u001b[40mx\u001b[19b\r\u001b[10d\u001b[37m\u001b[40m  .\u001b[16X\u001b[10;20Hwait a turn\u001b[30m\u001b[40mxxx\u001b[10;61H"]
[1.8e-05, "o", "x\u001b[19b\r\u001b[11d\u001b[37m\u001b[40m  a\u001b[16X\u001b[11;20Hat the shop: sell your findings and shop\u001b[30m\u001b[40mx\u001b[20b\u001b[12;29Hxxxxx\u001b[12;61H"]
[8e-06, "o", "x\u001b[19b\r\u001b[13d"]
[7e-06, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[37m\u001b[40mUnderground\u001b[13;29H\u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[30m\u001b[40mxxxxx\u001b[13;61H"]
[7e-06, "o", "x\u001b[19b\r\u001b[14d"]
[7e-06, "o", "\u001b[37m\u001b[40m  w   put down a ladder (climb up on ladders, rope and supports)\u001b[30m\u001b[40mx\u001b[15b\r\u001b[15d"]
[7e-06, "o", "\u001b[37m\u001b[40m  s   put up a support (stops boulders from falling)\u001b[15;61H"]
[7e-06, "o", "\u001b[30m\u001b[40mx\u001b[19b\r\u001b[16d\u001b[37m\u001b[40m  r   let a rope down from where you stand\u001b[16;61H"]
[7e-06, "o", "\u001b[30m\u001b[40mx\u001b[19b\r\u001b[17d"]
[1.6e-05, "o", "\u001b[37m\u001b[40m  f   fire the crossbow (then a direction); needs bolts\u001b[30m\u001b[40mx\u001b[24b\r\u001b[18d\u001b[37m\u001b[40m  d   light a stick of dynamite (it blows in three turns: run!)\u001b[30m\u001b[40mx\u001b[16b\u001b[19;61Hx\u001b[19b\r\u001b[20d"]
[8e-06, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[37m\u001b[40mStaying alive\u001b[20;61H"]
[7e-06, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[30m\u001b[40mx\u001b[19b\r\u001b[21d"]
[7e-06, "o", "\u001b[37m\u001b[40m  Digging and climbing cost stamina. Out of stamina, every effort costs\u001b[30m\u001b[40mx\u001b[8b\r\u001b[22d"]
[7e-06, "o", "\u001b[37m\u001b[40m  health instead. Stamina comes back on the surface; health only at the\u001b[30m\u001b[40mx\u001b[8b\r\u001b[23d"]
[7e-06, "o", "\u001b[37m\u001b[40m  shop's doctor (h in the upgrade screen).\u001b[23;61H"]
[7e-06, "o", "\u001b[30m\u001b[40mx\u001b[19b\r\u001b[24d\u001b[37m\u001b[40m  Falls of more than four tiles hurt. Boulders (0) fall when you dig\u001b[30m\u001b[40mx\u001b[11b\u001b[24;69H"]
[7e-06, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m"]
